**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.env
**/.runtime/
**/target/
**/circuits/**/Prover.toml
**/circuits/**/Prover-*.toml

# Each uploads/proofs directory carries a nested .gitignore that preserves only
# the placeholder. These root rules provide defense in depth for new profiles.
**/uploads/**
!**/uploads/**/
!**/uploads/**/.gitignore
**/proofs/**
!**/proofs/**/
!**/proofs/**/.gitignore
